h":57,"s":67,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"67:29","t":"Say, \"He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"67:30","t":"Say, \"Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"68:1","t":"Nūn. By the pen and what they inscribe,","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"68:2","t":"You are not, [O Muḥammad], by the favor of your Lord, a madman.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"68:3","t":"And indeed, for you is a reward uninterrupted.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"68:4","t":"And indeed, you are of a great moral character.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"68:5","t":"So you will see and they will see.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"68:6","t":"Which of you is the afflicted [by a devil].","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"68:7","t":"Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"68:8","t":"Then do not obey the deniers.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"68:9","t":"They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"68:10","t":"And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"68:11","t":"[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"68:12","t":"A preventer of good, transgressing and sinful,","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"68:13","t":"Cruel, moreover, and an illegitimate pretender.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"68:14","t":"Because he is a possessor of wealth and children,","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"68:15","t":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"68:16","t":"We will brand him upon the snout.","j":29,"h":57,"s":68,"a":16,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[67,68],"sajdah":false}